        Premium and specialty fuels (E5, B7_PREMIUM, B10) have significantly lower station coverage,
        reflecting their niche market position. Stations reporting only a single fuel type may represent
        either limited product offerings or incomplete reporting.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── KEY FINDINGS & POLICY IMPLICATIONS ──────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" id="key-findings">
    <h2>6. Key Findings & Policy Implications</h2>
    <p>
