            <strong>{fmt_ppl(price_stats.loc['E10', 'iqr'])} ppl</strong>. B7_STANDARD (diesel) shows a similar
            pattern with an IQR of <strong>{fmt_ppl(price_stats.loc['B7_STANDARD', 'iqr'])} ppl</strong>.
            This means a consumer who shops around can realistically save
            {fmt_ppl(price_stats.loc['E10', 'iqr'])}+ pence per litre — a material difference for household budgets.
        </p>
        <div class="policy-note">Policy implication: Price comparison tools and transparency mandates should be maintained and promoted to help consumers benefit from available price differences.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="finding">
